{"id": 88756, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Dark Iron Dwarfの野営地からStolen Explosivesを$N1個取り戻す。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-obj-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "32f23dfc5250a94f", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70338"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 88756, "field": "description", "ja": "Dark Ironsはここから東のDireforge Hillにいくつか野営地を構えとる。奴らはわしらの建設現場からexplosivesをごっそり盗んで、自分らのテントに運び込んだんだ。\n\nDark Ironsが火薬樽ひとつでどんな悪さをしでかすか、わざわざ言うまでもねえだろう！\n\nDark Ironsが危険なのは分かっとるが、あの樽は取り返さにゃならん。ほかの樽とは、赤い印がついとるから見分けがつく。Dark Ironsにくれてやるわけにはいかん！", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-desc-a-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "f19bd9f0f728fd52", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70338"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
