{"id": 88757, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Essene's Necklace、Essene's Spellbook、Essene's Waterskinを持ち帰る。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-obj-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "8dd0b2c0a78fe740", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70338"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 88757, "field": "description", "ja": "Dark Ironsから逃げている間に、装備をたくさん落としてしまった！\n\nどうやらなくしたのは……緑の革のwaterskinと、spellbookと、necklaceと……とにかく、どれも必要なものなんだ！\n\n私が荷物を詰め直して息を整えている間に見つけてくれたら、すごく助かる。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-desc-a-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "d5dd92b9e5068284", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70338"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
