{"id": 88758, "field": "objectives", "ja": "EsseneのメモをCorma Villardのもとへ持ち帰る。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-obj-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "12fd10da990783f7", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70338"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 88758, "field": "description", "ja": "あとは荷物を詰め直すだけで、ここから出られる！\n\n最後にもうひとつ頼みを聞いてくれるなら、ほら、このメモをCormaに届けてくれ。私が生きていて、今そっちへ向かっていると伝わるはずだ！", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-b70245-desc-a-sg12@2026-10-07", "imported": "2026-10-07"}, "english": {"hash": "3d2951ce28a67aee", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70338"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
